                "title": "Data Source",
                "dataSource": {
                    "value": {
                        "text": "Project Alpha - Sprint Planning Meeting Notes\nAttendees: Alice (PM), Bob (Lead Dev), Clara (Designer), Dev (QA)\n\nPoints discussed:\n- Current sprint velocity is 32 points, down from 38 last sprint. Bob mentioned team was blocked by API changes from the backend team.\n- Clara proposed new onboarding flow design. Everyone agreed it's much cleaner. Bob estimated 8 story points for implementation.\n- Dev raised concern about increasing bug count in the payment module - 15 new bugs this sprint.\n- Alice announced client demo is moved to May 15th. Need to have payment fixes ready by May 12th.\n- Team agreed to allocate 20% of next sprint to tech debt - Bob will lead the effort.\n- New hire starts Monday - Clara to prepare onboarding docs.\n\nAction Items:\n- Bob: Fix payment API integration by May 10th\n- Clara: Prepare onboarding design docs by Monday\n- Dev: Prioritize payment bugs, create test plan\n- Alice: Confirm client demo time and send calendar invite",
                        "files": []
                    },
                    "type": "markdown"
                }
            },
            "measured": {
                "width": 160,
                "height": 40
            },
            "selected": false,
            "dragging": false
        },
        {
            "id": "bbcc22dd-ee33-4bb2-99aa-334455667788",
            "type": "llm-process",
            "position": {
                "x": 310,
                "y": 90
            },
            "data": {
                "title": "AI Data Processing",
                "model": "",
                "prompt": "You are a meeting notes summarizer. Process the input and produce a structured summary.\n\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object:\n{\n  \"meetingTitle\": \"extracted or inferred title\",\n  \"date\": \"extracted or current date\",\n  \"attendees\": [\"name1\", \"name2\"],\n  \"keyDecisions\": [\"decision 1\", \"decision 2\"],\n  \"actionItems\": [\n    {\"assignee\": \"name\", \"task\": \"description\", \"deadline\": \"date or ASAP\"}\n  ],\n  \"risksAndConcerns\": [\"concern 1\"],\n  \"nextSteps\": [\"step 1\"]\n}\n\nDo NOT include any explanations or markdown outside the JSON.",
                "message": {},
                "format": {
                    "onSuccess": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"meetingTitle\", \"attendees\", \"keyDecisions\", \"actionItems\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"meetingTitle\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"attendees\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"keyDecisions\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"actionItems\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"assignee\", \"task\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"assignee\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"task\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"deadline\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"risksAndConcerns\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}},\n    \"nextSteps\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}\n  }\n}",
                    "onError": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"error\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"error\"]\n}"
                },
                "maxFeedbackLoops": 1
            },
